## 2. Tabel Baru: `settlement_batches`

Pecahan settlement per CMS Partner per periode:

```sql
CREATE TABLE settlement_batches (
  id                   TEXT PRIMARY KEY,
  settlement_id        TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES settlements(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,
  cms_partner_id       TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES cms_partners(id),
  period               TEXT NOT NULL,                        -- 'YYYY-MM'

  -- Amounts dari report CMS
  total_gross_usd      DECIMAL(20,6) DEFAULT 0,
  total_net_usd        DECIMAL(20,6) DEFAULT 0,
  exchange_rate        DECIMAL(15,2) DEFAULT 0,
  total_payout_idr     DECIMAL(15,2) DEFAULT 0,

  -- Status & approval
  status               TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'draft',
  -- draft → calculated → approved → pending_fund → partial → realized
  approved_by          TEXT REFERENCES users(id),
  approved_at          TIMESTAMP,

  -- Fund realization tracking
  realized_amount_idr  DECIMAL(15,2) DEFAULT 0,
  realization_pct      DECIMAL(5,2) DEFAULT 0,
  fully_realized_at    TIMESTAMP,

  -- Hybrid visibility: admin pilih per batch
  visibility           TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'visible',  -- 'visible' | 'hidden'
  -- visible = user lihat sebagai "Dalam Proses Pencairan"
  -- hidden  = user tidak lihat sama sekali, saldo muncul saat realize

  notes                TEXT,
  created_at           TIMESTAMP DEFAULT now(),
  updated_at           TIMESTAMP DEFAULT now(),

  UNIQUE(settlement_id, cms_partner_id)
);
```

### State Machine

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> draft: Batch dibuat otomatis
    draft --> calculated: Hitung revenue & split
    calculated --> approved: Admin approve batch ini
    approved --> pending_fund: Publish → kredit accrued
    pending_fund --> partial: Dana masuk sebagian
    pending_fund --> realized: Dana masuk 100%
    partial --> realized: Sisa dana masuk
    draft --> skipped: Admin skip (ragu dengan CMS)
    skipped --> calculated: Admin yakin, proses ulang
```

