## 8. API Endpoints

| Endpoint | Method | Fungsi |
|----------|--------|--------|
| `/api/finance/settlements/[id]/batches` | GET | List batch dalam settlement |
| `/api/finance/settlements/[id]/batches` | POST | Generate batch per CMS |
| `/api/finance/batches/[id]/approve` | POST | Approve satu batch |
| `/api/finance/batches/[id]/publish` | POST | Publish → kredit accrued |
| `/api/finance/batches/[id]/visibility` | PATCH | Toggle visible/hidden |
| `/api/finance/batches/[id]/realize` | POST | Input fund realization |
| `/api/finance/batches/[id]/realizations` | GET | Riwayat pembayaran |
| `/api/finance/realizations/bulk` | POST | FIFO auto-split multi-periode |

